      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al fin llegaron al borde de Kīlauea. Abajo, en el fuego, estaban Pele y sus hermanas.",
          "en": "At last they reached the rim of Kīlauea. Down below, in the fire, were Pele and her sisters."
        },
        {
          "es": "Wahineʻōmaʻo y otra amiga bajaron primero, para contarle a Pele todo el viaje.",
          "en": "Wahineʻōmaʻo and another friend went down first, to tell Pele about the whole journey."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Pele no quiso escuchar. Furiosa por la demora, las cubrió de fuego.",
          "en": "But Pele would not listen. Furious at the delay, she covered them with fire."
        },
        {
          "es": "Arriba, Hiʻiaka lo vio. Y algo se rompió en ella.",
          "en": "Up above, Hiʻiaka saw it. And something broke inside her."
        }
      ],
