      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Sus hermanas se pusieron sus mantos de fuego y subieron. Pero no querían hacerlo.",
          "en": "Her sisters put on their robes of fire and went up. But they did not want to."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cuando vieron a Lohiʻau de cerca, dijeron: «Su cara brilla como la luna. Su espalda es recta como un acantilado».",
          "en": "When they saw Lohiʻau up close, they said: \"His face is bright as the moon. His back is straight as a cliff.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Le tiraron unas pocas cenizas, solo para disimular, y se fueron corriendo, avergonzadas.",
          "en": "They threw a few cinders at him, just for show, and ran away, ashamed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hasta los dioses de Pele se negaron. Dijeron que era injusto, y soplaron las llamas lejos.",
          "en": "Even Pele's gods refused. They called it unjust, and blew the flames away."
        }
      ],
