      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces Pele misma rodeó a los dos con fuego.",
          "en": "Then Pele herself surrounded the two of them with fire."
        },
        {
          "es": "A Hiʻiaka no le hizo nada. Tenía cuerpo de diosa.",
          "en": "It could not harm Hiʻiaka. She had the body of a goddess."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Lohiʻau era un hombre. Donde la lava lo tocaba, se volvía piedra.",
          "en": "But Lohiʻau was a man. Wherever the lava touched him, he turned to stone."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hasta que todo su cuerpo quedó cubierto. Y su espíritu salió volando.",
          "en": "Until his whole body was covered. And his spirit flew away."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿A quién culpas tú: a Pele, a Hiʻiaka o a Lohiʻau?",
          "en": "Who do you blame: Pele, Hiʻiaka, or Lohiʻau?"
        }
      ],
